From f6eb825d6b517100c0fa094d5f0caa55fa7face8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ant=C3=B3nio=20Sarmento?= <Keyaku@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 18:43:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Default the rotation-suggestion button to off

AOSP defaults Settings.Secure.show_rotation_suggestions to enabled, and no
Settings UI anywhere exposes it. On a landscape handheld with a small screen
the suggestion button is a net negative, so the ROM default is flipped. An
explicit user setting still wins, and a factory reset returns to this default
rather than to AOSP.

Changes:
- Read SHOW_ROTATION_SUGGESTIONS with SHOW_ROTATION_SUGGESTIONS_DISABLED as the fallback in DisplayRotation, the single call site that drives the behaviour

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I058abaacc5d321ff12166b998662f851fd2d7cb2
---
 .../core/java/com/android/server/wm/DisplayRotation.java    | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/DisplayRotation.java b/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/DisplayRotation.java
index b581d49b..a07cb84d 100644
--- a/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/DisplayRotation.java
+++ b/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/DisplayRotation.java
@@ -1388,13 +1388,15 @@ public class DisplayRotation {
         synchronized (mLock) {
             boolean shouldUpdateOrientationListener = false;
 
-            // Configure rotation suggestions.
+            // Configure rotation suggestions. The default is DISABLED rather than
+            // AOSP's ENABLED: this device is landscape with a small screen, where the
+            // suggestion button is a net negative. An explicit user setting still wins.
             final int showRotationSuggestions =
                     ActivityManager.isLowRamDeviceStatic()
                             ? Settings.Secure.SHOW_ROTATION_SUGGESTIONS_DISABLED
                             : Settings.Secure.getIntForUser(resolver,
                             Settings.Secure.SHOW_ROTATION_SUGGESTIONS,
-                            Settings.Secure.SHOW_ROTATION_SUGGESTIONS_DEFAULT,
+                            Settings.Secure.SHOW_ROTATION_SUGGESTIONS_DISABLED,
                             UserHandle.USER_CURRENT);
             if (mShowRotationSuggestions != showRotationSuggestions) {
                 mShowRotationSuggestions = showRotationSuggestions;
